The greatest common divisor of two whole numbers, by Euclid's method. The input is the pair [a b]. The gcd of 0 and 0 is 0.
---

---
(fn p (letrec g (fn (a b) (if (= b 0) a (g b (% a b)))) (g (head p) (tail p))))
---
[12 18] => 6 fuel 100000
[7 13] => 1 fuel 100000
[0 5] => 5 fuel 100000
[9 0] => 9 fuel 100000
[100 75] => 25 fuel 100000
